[[13799,5380,"No training record is kept to evidence when training /practice took place","lack of training record",""],[13800,5380,"Training was not in accordance with BSAC Sports Diver training","non compliance with BSAC training",""],[13801,5380,"The plan for the second dive was for Mr Cronin to inflate the DSMB from a depth of around 17 metres. It took place at 20 metres. The BSAC instructions for Sports Diver are for the exercise to be conducted at 10 metres","incorrect DSMB inflation depth",""],[13802,5380,"A diver without the necessary qualifications and experience was permitted to teach Mr Cronin with no instruction otherwise","unqualified instructor teaching",""],[13803,5380,"No written risk assessments /templates were completed to ensure those responsible for the dive have focused their minds to relevant circumstances","absence of risk assessment",""],[13804,5380,"The dive was not properly planned. A Safety and Development Manager employed by BSAC said he would not have done the final dive in the way that it was planned and conducted","improper dive planning",""]]